<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:20:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>奥驰亚研究卷烟制造商帝国品牌的交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands</link><description>奥驰亚集团公司正在研究一项收购英国卷烟制造商帝国品牌公司的潜在交易，这将是十年来对英国公司最大的收购之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands'&gt;奥驰亚研究卷烟制造商帝国品牌的交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Altria, Japan Tobacco Explore Breakup of Imperial Brands&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:08:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</link><description>由于中东持续的敌对行动可能破坏该地区原油出口的复苏，石油价格连续两天上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26'&gt;11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 26&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:03:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>（美元：南非兰特）11 月兰特兑美元汇率跌至 25 年来最差水平</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/-usd-zar-rand-hurtles-toward-worst-november-against-dollar-in-25-years</link><description>南非兰特正受到国内和全球不利因素的冲击，导致南非兰特兑美元汇率在 11 月份遭遇 25 年来最差的表现。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/-usd-zar-rand-hurtles-toward-worst-november-against-dollar-in-25-years'&gt;（美元：南非兰特）11 月兰特兑美元汇率跌至 25 年来最差水平&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：(USD:ZAR) Rand Hurtles Toward Worst November Against Dollar in 25 Years&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/-usd-zar-rand-hurtles-toward-worst-november-against-dollar-in-25-years</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 14:59:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Global Stocks Climb as AI Trade Mounts a Comeback: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>套利平仓导致墨西哥比索出现 2021 年以来最严重连跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/mexican-peso-sees-worst-losing-streak-since-2021-on-carry-unwind</link><description>随着投资者纷纷转向避险资产以及流行的套利交易瓦解，墨西哥比索正面临五年来最长的连续下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/mexican-peso-sees-worst-losing-streak-since-2021-on-carry-unwind'&gt;套利平仓导致墨西哥比索出现 2021 年以来最严重连跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Mexican Peso Sees Worst Losing Streak Since 2021 on Carry Unwind&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/mexican-peso-sees-worst-losing-streak-since-2021-on-carry-unwind</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:07:52 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>